    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH2d1735-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-234a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">From the root to the tip, the fruit is born,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-234a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">as large as an orange.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-234a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">It is edible.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-234a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">When overripe,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-234a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">it may contain honey inside.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-234a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">A single tree</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-234a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">often bears dozens of fruits."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-235a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-235a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">The *Sōng Shān Jì* (Record of Mount Song) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-235a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">"In the Sōng Temple, suddenly there appeared a *sīwéi shù* (contemplation tree),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-235a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">which is the *bèiduō* (贝多) tree.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-235a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">Someone sat under the *bèiduō* tree contemplating,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-235a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">hence the name.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-235a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">A Hàn dynasty Daoist came from a foreign country,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-235a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">and planted its seeds at the foot of the western mountain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-235a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">where it grew extremely tall.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-235a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">Now there are four trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-235a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">which bloom three times a year."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-236a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-236a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">*Xiāng*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-236a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">Gù Wēi's (顧微) *Guǎngzhōu Jì* (廣州記, Record of Guangzhou) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-236a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">"*Xiāng*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-236a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">has leaves and fruits that resemble pepper;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-236a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">its taste is like basil.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-236a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">North of the mountain ridge, it is called 'wooden basil'."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-236a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">*Suōluó* (娑羅)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-237a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-237a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">Shèng Hóngzhī's (盛弘之) *Jīngzhōu Jì* (荊州記, Record of Jingzhou) says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-237a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">"South of Bālíng (巴陵) County, there is a temple.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-237a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">Under the monks' bedchamber,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-237a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">suddenly a tree grew.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-237a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">Within ten days of its growth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-237a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">its momentum surpassed the eaves and beams.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2d1735_CHANT_094-237a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:45:47.243+09:00">The Daoist moved the room to avoid it.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
